flowchart TD
  Assign[Actual builder assignment] --> Ready[Idle builder / own unfinished site]
  Ready -->|real local material| Build[Present earned builder work]
  Ready -->|own-site material shortage| Claim[Existing real M11 haul demand / claim]
  Common[Common Hauling] --> Claim
  Claim --> Carry[Physical pickup / carry / deposit]
  Carry --> Report[Report back to own duty / safe handoff]
  Report --> Build
  Build --> Complete[Actual paid completion / capability once]
  Complete --> Profile[Measured activation / visual / geometry costs]
  Complete --> Smoke[Four finite Artist smoke entrances1.5s]
  Smoke --> Snip[Authored scissors retimed2.0s]
  Snip --> Tape[Actual cut contact / tape fall]
  Tape --> Pylon[Ground contact / pylon grow and shrink]
  Pause[Existing Pause /1x /2x] --> Smoke
  Pause --> Snip
  Cancel[Cancel or session teardown] --> Safe[Existing custody / finite visual cleanup]
